### 9.3 性能问题

**Q: 推理延迟过高**
```javascript
// 优化特征提取
const features = featureExtractor.extract(windowData);

// 缓存计算结果
const cache = new Map();
function cachedExtract(data) {
  const key = JSON.stringify(data);
  if (cache.has(key)) {
    return cache.get(key);
  }
  const result = featureExtractor.extract(data);
  cache.set(key, result);
  return result;
}
```

